    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 20</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XVIII} Gif mon oðres monnes munuce feoh oðfæste butan ðæs munuces hlafordes lefnesse, ⁊ hit him losige, þolige his se ðe hit ǽr ahte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone entrusts property to another man’s monk without the permission of the monk’s lord, and it is lost from him, let him who owned it before forfeit it.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If property is entrusted to a monk in the service of another man without the permission of the monk's lord, and he loses it, the former owner shall bear the loss.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XVIII. Gif mon oþres mannes munuce buton (his) hlafordes leafe feoh befæste, ond hit him losie, ðolige his se ðe hit ær ahte.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
